# WHAT A FRAME COSTS WHERE A PLAYER IS (ROADMAP 9, frame-time budgets on the
# web): one `--stats` window (p50/p95/p99/worst past warm-up) per scene a player
# lives in, walking or turning on the real keys: the coast by day, a fight, a
# village at night, a crowd fight at dusk under its lamps, the pinewood over the
# shoulder, and a room. The cave's are tours/cave-cost.tour's. Measured
# uncapped, so the number is the frame's cost and not the display's pace.
#   tools/web.sh --tour=tours/web-frames.tour --uncapped --timeout=900 --trace --args=--seed=7,--weather=clear:0,--stats
#   tools/tour.sh tours/web-frames.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --stats
coast calm
hour 11
place coast
wait 2.0
perf stats begin
walk 1,0 2.0
walk 0,1 2.0
walk -1,0 2.0
perf stats end coast_day
shot 01-coast-day

spawn runner
spawn harvester
wait 1.0
perf stats begin
hold swing
walk 1,0 1.5
wait 1.5
release swing
press dodge
walk -1,0 1.5
wait 1.0
perf stats end fight_day
shot 02-fight-day
coast calm

hour 23
near house
wait 2.0
perf stats begin
walk -1,0 2.0
walk 0,-1 2.0
walk 1,0 2.0
perf stats end village_night
shot 03-village-night

hour 19.5
near house
wait 1.5
spawn runner
spawn runner@90
spawn harvester@180
spawn cutter@270
wait 1.0
perf stats begin
hold swing
walk 1,0 1.5
wait 1.5
release swing
press dodge
walk 0,1 1.5
wait 1.0
perf stats end crowd_dusk
shot 04-crowd-dusk
coast calm

hour 11
place pinewood
wait 1.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 2.0
perf stats begin
walk 0,-1 2.0
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 1.0
mouse 640,0 0.6
walk 0,-1 2.0
perf stats end pinewood_shoulder
shot 05-pinewood-shoulder with shoulder
tap shoulder
wait 1.0

near door:cottage
await door 10
press use 0.1
await inside:cottage 30
wait 2.0
perf stats begin
walk 1,0 1.5
walk -1,0 1.5
wait 1.0
perf stats end room
shot 06-room with inside:cottage
